  first | exact @GlobalTheory.IsSiegel.neg_mul_inv_of_symplectic | exact GlobalTheory.IsSiegel.neg_mul_inv_of_symplectic | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.IsSiegel.neg_mul_inv_of_symplectic <;> assumption)
